        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric sample of woven silk, made in Lyon, ca. 1875-1899."@en , "Dress fabric sample of woven silk. Two wide vertical bands with a ground of green-gold and central narrower band of green. Ribbed ground with the green central part having wider ribs than the outer bands. Outer bands have a pattern of corn leaves in cream satin weave with details in gold."@en ;
